abstract: Independent AI reading of 21 official frames was compared with the frozen
  initial transcription, followed by non-blind source-image adjudication of 37 target
  physical faces. This version has 344 units, 5089 Unicode code points, 90 changed
  unit strings and 49 located unresolved records. Nine inspected residual-ink regions
  have unresolved text extent and origin. Changes and uncertainties are not error
  or accuracy estimates. Independent raw observations include omissions and unresolved
  paratext readings; their original outputs were retained. No human double collation,
  expert review, peer review or measured accuracy is claimed. This is historical-document
  digitization and publication without biological research or a modern procedural
  guide.
